  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formula and Baby WASH for the babies in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHO is among a few NGOs in Ethiopia that provides unique pivotal loving Day drop services for children of poor mother . Every day MHO reached out  homeless women and children in Addis Ababa and Bahir Dar who have been  forced to live  street for a variety of reasons, including abject poverty,  GBV persecution  , family breakdown, Parental deaths, parental neglect, and other social. There are 130 impoverished mothers and 250 children presently sheltered In MHO  rehabilitation In A.A and Bahir Dar</narrative>
  </description>
